&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identifying new pathways for growth at Discord.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Identify and evaluate new opportunities for growth across paid and owned channels, building strong business cases and justifications for investment across all our key audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own &amp;amp; Execute the Growth Roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the creation and execution of growth marketing roadmaps, identifying key technical tools, resources, and innovative approaches to unlock growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Data Science teams to identify and deliver the technical requirements needed to support growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven optimization&lt;/strong&gt;. Leverage quantitative insights to optimize the customer journey, working closely with research and data science to pinpoint opportunities and eliminate gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; lifecycle expertise. &lt;/strong&gt;12+ years of experience in marketing with a strong focus on growth and lifecycle marketing. Media buying experience is nice to have, but not strictly required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong technical ability. &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to work closely with Product, Data Science, and Engineering teams to shape and implement marketing technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balanced Decision-Making: A strong grasp of quantitative data coupled with excellent judgment to refine strategies and ask the right questions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion for Discord. &lt;/strong&gt;A deep passion for Discord’s mission, our business, our products, what we’re building for our customers, and the gaming industry at large.&lt;/li&gt;
